OL,3,GNEWSAShetland's first paramedic to
OL,4,Aretire after 38 years of island-hopping
OL,5,Acall outs
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore Niall Bristow joined the
OL,8,Fambulance service in Shetland in 1988,
OL,9,Fthe vehicles were driven by hospital
OL,10,Fporters and gardeners with no medical
OL,11,Ftraining.
OL,13,FHe initially trained as an ambulance
OL,14,Ftechnician, before becoming the isles'
OL,15,Fsole paramedic in 1992.
OL,17,FNow there are 11 paramedics and six
OL,18,Ftechnicians serving the population of
OL,19,F23,000 on Shetland's 16 inhabited
OL,20,Fislands.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
