OL,3,GNEWSAShetland's first paramedic to
OL,4,Aretire after 38 years of island-hopping
OL,5,Acall outs
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd after a career which has even seen
OL,8,Fhim feature in BBC TV shows like
OL,9,FShetland and Island Medics, Niall is
OL,10,Fretiring at the age of 61.
